Package: MUST
Title: More Urban Spatial Tools
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Joeri", "Morpurgo", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                     email = "j.morpurgo@cml.leidenuniv.nl",
                     comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7286-1991")))
Description: For spatio-temporal urban environmental analysis, More Urban Spatial Tools (MUST) simplifies routine GIS steps by collecting, processing and analyzing data. It combines remote sensing satellite data from OpenEo and land-use land-cover (LULC) data from Ohsome (historical repository of Open Street Maps (OSM)). Functions cover retrieving municipal borders, estimating urban borders, retrieving LULC data, retrieving remote sensing indicators (Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, Enhanced Vegetation Index, Modified Soil Adjusted Vegetation Index, Normalized Difference Moisture Index, Land Surface Temperature), estimating vegetation index thresholds, estimating vegetation coverages and calculating several urban ecologically relevant spatio-temporal landscape-level metrics. 
Maintainer: Joeri Morpurgo <j.morpurgo@cml.leidenuniv.nl>
